    'Working assumption: route access causes both invitation receipt and attendance; invitation can also affect attendance. Build that graph and compare observation with a randomized invitation intervention.',
    'Add 24 nodes to two seed networks. One attaches uniformly and one in proportion to existing degree. Remove random nodes or high-degree hubs and compare the largest connected component.',
    'Four original fictional tracks compete in parallel simulated music markets. Listener assignments use a seeded random generator. Compare independent choice with popularity-visible choice across independent worlds.',
    'Choose up to three initial adopters. Compare a one-exposure rule with a two-neighbor reinforcement rule, using a clustered network and a rewired network. Run several rounds, not just one hop.',
    'King, Pan, and Roberts contribute to an educational dramatization. Their 2013 study is the historical anchor; this invented Bellwether platform is a new teaching corpus. Archive posts before and after removal, then classify criticism separately from calls for joint action.',
